# Keep only what the image build needs in the context:
# go.mod/go.sum, server/ and the static files in web/.
#
# This is not only about image size. Everything listed here is sent to the
# daemon before the first instruction runs, so an unfiltered context makes
# `docker build` feel slow for no reason at all.
.git
.github
docs
deploy
scripts
tests
*.md
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
.env
.env.*
.dockerignore
**/*_test.go
# A binary built on the host: same name as the one the image builds, and it
# has no business travelling into the context.
hexeris
